    "title": "Casual Color - Color by Number",
    "description": "Casual Coloring - Color by number for adults, also known as paint by number, coloring book, painting games, is an art drawing game to color modern artworks with coloring by numbers.With 5,000+ coloring pages which are different from other painting games, you'll never run out of options to paint by numbers. Whether you are coloring to reduce stress or simply to relax, you\u2019ll love coloring by number with this painting game.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n<b>Simple & Easy to Color</b>\r\nChoose the pic you like and paint by number, then tap the shade to follow the clues.\r\n\r\n<b>Tons of pictures with popular categories</b>\r\nThere are various coloring pages in different categories to paint: Animal, Mandala, Scenery, Nature, Life, Plant, Flowers, Food, Fantasy, Special date, Fashion .Cute puppies\u3001beautiful and mind-calming flowers and bouquets are all ready for coloring.Our coloring pages range from easy to very detailed and suit any taste and mood\r\n\r\n<b>New pictures to paint by number every day</b>\r\nYou will get fresh coloring pages everyday in our coloring books.\r\n\r\n<b>Quick sharing</b>\r\nColor by number and share your own  artwork on the social media.\r\n\r\nStart playing anti-stress coloring games and unleash your talented inner artist! Leave anxiety behind with Casual Coloring - Color by Number for adults games.",
